              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "curious cook"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Thanks for this recipe! I made a few modifications. I substituted carrots for the celery, and added fresh spinach at the end for some extra nutrition and flavor. I also added smoky tempeh for enhanced protein, while still keeping it meatless. It was simple, delicious and fast to make. I'll definitely make this again!"
